# Anna. The SAME two parts as the player, plus a hat, plus two colour swaps — and
# that is the whole demonstration: nobody drew Anna. She is a recipe over parts, so
# she is consistent with the player by construction rather than by care, and the
# next villager costs three lines rather than a drawing.
mix1
name farm_anna
size 16 16
sheet parts textures/parts_farm.hrt 16
part parts 1 at 0 0
part parts 0 at 0 0
part parts 2 at 0 0
swap 5b3a29 8a6f3a
swap 6e8fb5 b5566e
